* Modeline Segment Order

Left to right per row; the setup recomposes on save. Row 1 is the
identity row (top), row 2 the context row. Keyboard letters always
lead row 1. Both sides always render exactly two lines (empty rows
render blank, never dropped), so the stacked pairing never breaks.

** Row 1 Left
*** keyboard-state
*** modified
*** buffer-id
*** position
** Row 1 Right
*** vc
*** cyberdeck
** Row 2 Left
*** doctor
** Row 2 Right
*** datetime
